description=Follows the playing track's sample rate on USB DACs (optional bit-perfect output). Backend: USB_SampleRate_Changer by zyhk (bundled, unmodified). Based on BitPerfect-DAC by varunpilankar. Auto-follow, pause/resume on switch, WebUI, diagnostics. EXPERIMENTAL.
